Every noninjective readout of the named PairIntent runtime contains an exact
authority kernel.  This module generates the collision from noninjectivity,
chooses its kernel pair internally, and publishes the smallest source-owned
runtime-label witness which separates the chosen endpoints.

No caller supplies endpoints, a collision equality, witness verdict, decoder,
authority target, occurrence registry, depth schedule, or completed future.
-/

